  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ClipForge Video & Audio Processing Automation\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow exposes a webhook endpoint that starts a ClipForge processing run through the Apify API. After triggering the Apify actor, it fetches the processed dataset output and returns those results directly in the webhook response.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the Webhook Trigger URL and HTTP method expected by the calling application.\n- Add or verify Apify API authentication for the HTTP Request nodes, including the token used to call the ClipForge actor and dataset endpoints.\n- Confirm the actor ID, request body, and dataset ID expression in the two HTTP Request nodes match the intended ClipForge/Apify setup.\n- Ensure the Respond to Webhook node returns the desired dataset fields and response format.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the ClipForge actor input payload, dataset fetch URL, or webhook response mapping to change what media is processed and what results are returned.",
        "width": 480,
        "height": 752
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [ -368, -224 ],
      "id": "f0e85944-a8f1-47a1-b480-09e938f31d32",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Receive webhook request\n\nStarts the automation when an external system calls the webhook endpoint.",
        "width": 240,
        "height": 320,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [ 192, -176 ],
      "id": "7fdaf193-daaa-48d1-b31a-54d2e947f2cc",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Run ClipForge processing\n\nSends a POST request to the Apify ClipForge actor, then retrieves the processed dataset output from Apify. These two HTTP nodes are adjacent on the canvas and form the main processing cluster.",
        "width": 416,
        "height": 368,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [ 464, -224 ],
      "id": "43997cdd-449c-41bd-859d-8a114eeb7425",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Return processed results\n\nSends the fetched ClipForge dataset results back to the original webhook caller.",
        "width": 240,
        "height": 384,
        "color": 7
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [ 912, -224 ],
      "id": "4fbbc987-3729-4b7b-a1c8-f0f8b96d89a5",
      "name": "Sticky Note3"
    },
    {
      "id": "f94ad00d-e06d-4918-bf64-2bccf06dede3",
      "name": "When ClipForge Process Initiated",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "position": [ 240, -16 ],
      "webhookId": "6a2cd212-cbe7-4d63-9f6c-d89e59597e03",
      "parameters": {
        "path": "clipforge-process",
        "options": {},
        "httpMethod": "POST"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "6c46bd03-f16a-4196-aa5f-bcb013ddc796",
      "name": "Start ClipForge Processing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [ 512, -16 ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api.apify.com/v2/acts/budding_retrograde~clipforge/runs",
        "method": "POST",
        "options": {},
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"videoUrl\": \"{{ $json.body.videoUrl }}\",\n  \"startTime\": \"{{ $json.body.startTime || '' }}\",\n  \"endTime\": \"{{ $json.body.endTime || '' }}\",\n  \"extractAudio\": {{ $json.body.extractAudio || false }},\n  \"audioBitrate\": \"{{ $json.body.audioBitrate || '192k' }}\",\n  \"verticalReframe\": {{ $json.body.verticalReframe || false }}\n}",
        "sendBody": true,
        "sendQuery": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.apifyToken }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "waitForFinish",
              "value": "120"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.1
    },
    {
      "id": "c54de95c-2275-4b25-a1be-cb050239f210",
      "name": "Retrieve Processed ClipForge Data",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "position": [ 736, -16 ],
      "parameters": {
        "url": "=https://api.apify.com/v2/datasets/{{ $json.defaultDatasetId }}/items",
        "options": {},
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "token",
              "value": "={{ $('When ClipForge Process Initiated').item.json.body.apifyToken }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 4.1
    },
    {
      "id": "f70c32ba-47c4-4395-9e57-7b6fa0ea75b6",
      "name": "Send Response to Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "position": [ 960, -16 ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"processedData\": {{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
  ],
  "active": false,
  "pinData": {},
